       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115IMC0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Main_Contract.    00080000
      *                                                                 00090000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00100000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00110000
      *                                                                 00120000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00130000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00140000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00170000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210000
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115IMC0-Main-Contract   00230000
      *    Set   R115IMC0-Version        To    True                     00240000
      *    Set   R115IMC0-In-Select      To    True                     00250000
      *                                                                 00260000
      * One of these:                                                   00270000
      * 1) Set   R115IMC0-In-Actual      To    True                     00280000
      * 2) Set   R115IMC0-In-Work        To    True                     00290000
      *                                                                 00300000
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00310000
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-Type00320000
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-No  00330000
      *                                                                 00340000
      *    Call  'F115IMC0'              Using R115IMC0-Main-Contract   00350000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00360000
      *    End-Call                                                     00370000
      *                                                                 00380000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00390000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00400000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00410000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00420000
      *                                                                 00430000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00440000
      *        ...not found...                                          00450000
      *                                                                 00460000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00470000
      *        ...found...                                              00480000
      *                                                                 00490000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00500000
      *                                                                 00510000
      *################################################################*00520000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00530000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00540000
      *050927!NDL! Added cursor, use-None                        !NA35! 00541000
      *030703!NDL! Added -Silent-Comfirmation                    !LY15! 00541100
      *230401!NDL! Added -Incom-Swift                            !LT12! 00541200
      *130201!HLR! Added cursor C-FI-CN-Asc.                     !    ! 00541300
      *090201!HLR! Tuning - Removed cursor C-FI-CN-Asc.          !    ! 00541400
      *      !   !        - Removed cursor C-FI-CU-CN-Asc.       !    ! 00541500
      *190600!HLR! Removed cursors CT, CN and CT-CN (3, 4 and 9).!LO18! 00541600
      *      !   ! Changed cursor-qual. on TFMC_Contr_Type       !    ! 00541700
      *      !   ! from "Like" to "=".                           !    ! 00541800
      *      !   ! Cursor CU changed to FI-CU.                   !    ! 00541900
      *      !   ! Cursor CU-CT changed to FI-CU-CT.             !    ! 00542000
      *      !   ! Cursor CU-CN changed to FI-CU-CN.             !    ! 00543000
      *      !   ! Cursor CU-CT-CN changed to FI-CU-CT-CN.       !    ! 00544000
      *      !   ! Removed interval on contract-no.              !    ! 00545000
      *110899!HLR! Added cursor -Fi-CT-ST.                       !LG10! 00546000
      *290199!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00547000
