               10  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID      Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01380000
               10  W-DB-Customer-ID      Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01390000
               10  W-DB-Contract-Type    Pic  X(03).                    01400000
