           05  WE-Cursor-Info.                                          01470000
             07  WE-Key.                                                01480000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01490000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01500000
               10  WE-Customer-ID        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01510000
               10  WE-Customer-No        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01520000
               10  WE-Contr-Type         Pic  X(03).                    01530000
               10  WE-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01540000
               10  WE-Status             Pic  X(12).                    01550000
             07  WE-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01560000
               88  WE-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01570000
               88  WE-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01580000
      *                                                                 01590000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01600000
      * Storage, and switches for identifying the content:              01610000
      * The cursor info is used to verify that the get-next has the     01620000
      * same qualification as the get-1st.                              01630000
      *                                                                 01640000
       01  W-Storage.                                                   01650000
      *                                                                 01660000
           05  WS-Cursor-Info.                                          01670000
             07  WS-Key.                                                01680000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01690000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01700000
               10  WS-Customer-ID        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01710000
               10  WS-Customer-No        Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01720000
               10  WS-Contr-Type         Pic  X(03).                    01730000
               10  WS-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01740000
               10  WS-Status             Pic  X(12).                    01750000
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01760000
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01770000
               88  WS-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01780000
             07  WS-Cursor-Status        Pic  X(08).                    01790000
               88  WS-Cursor-OK                     Value 'OK'.         01800000
               88  WS-Cursor-End                    Value 'END'.        01810000
      *                                                                 01820000
      * We store all occurences that are read, also those that we do    01830000
      * not find. This is to reduce the number of DB2 accesses.         01840000
      *                                                                 01850000
           05  WS-DB2-Table.                                            01860000
             07  WS-DB2-Row              Occurs 10 Times.               01870000
               10  WS-DB2-Tbl-Version    Pic  X(16).                    01880000
               10  WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01890000
               10  WS-DB2-Contr-Type     Pic  X(03).                    01900000
               10  WS-DB2-Contr-No       Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01910000
               10  WS-DB2-Row-Status     Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.01920000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Read                Value +0.           01930000
                 88  WS-DB2-Read                    Value +1.           01940000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Found               Value +2.           01950000
               10  WS-DB2-DCL            Pic  X(250).                   01960000
