           .                                                            05560000
      *################################################################.05570000
       E000-Get-Next                     Section.                       05580000
      *                                                                 05590000
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   05600000
           Perform E100-Check-Qualification                             05610000
           Perform E200-Fetch-Cursor                                    05620000
      *                                                                 05630000
           If  R7919999-Return-OK                                       05640000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   05650000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 05660000
           End-If                                                       05670000
      *                                                                 05680000
           .                                                            05690000
      *################################################################.05700000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       05710000
      *                                                                 05720000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         05730000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     05740000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    05750000
      *                                                                 05760000
           Evaluate True                                                05770000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05780000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05790000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          05800000
               Continue                                                 05810000
      *                                                                 05820000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05830000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05840000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         05850000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05860000
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05870000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05880000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05890000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05900000
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05910000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05920000
      *                                                                 05930000
             When Other                                                 05940000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05950000
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05960000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05970000
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05980000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05990000
      *                                                                 06000000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06010000
      *                                                                 06020000
           .                                                            06030000
      *################################################################.06040000
       E200-Fetch-Cursor                 Section.                       06050000
      *                                                                 06060000
           Initialize                          R115IMCS-SQL-Submodules  06070000
           Set   R115IMCS-Version        To    True                     06080000
           Set   R115IMCS-In-Fetch-Cursor                               06090000
                                         To    True                     06100000
           Move  R115IMC0-In-Table-Version                              06110000
                                         To    R115IMCS-In-Table-Version06120000
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115IMCS-Cursor-Code     06130000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115IMCS-DB-Key          06140000
      *                                                                 06150000
           Call  'F115IMCR'              Using R115IMCS-SQL-Submodules  06160000
                                               DCLTF-Main-Contract      06170000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06180000
           End-Call                                                     06190000
      *                                                                 06200000
           Evaluate True                                                06210000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06220000
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                06230000
      *                                                                 06240000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 06250000
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     06260000
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       06270000
                 Then                                                   06280000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06290000
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              06300000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06310000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06320000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06330000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06340000
                 Else                                                   06350000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06360000
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06370000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06380000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06390000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06400000
               End-If                                                   06410000
      *                                                                 06420000
             When other                                                 06430000
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06440000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06450000
      *                                                                 06460000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06470000
      *                                                                 06480000
           .                                                            06490000
      *################################################################.06500000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       06510000
      *                                                                 06520000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           06530000
      *                                                                 06540000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       06550000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               06560000
      *                                                                 06570000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        06580000
      *                                                                 06590000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     06600000
      *                                                                 06610000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         06620000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 06630000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  06640000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06650000
           End-If                                                       06660000
      *                                                                 06670000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       06680000
      *                                                                 06690000
           Evaluate True                                                06700000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  06710000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Main-Contract      06720000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 06730000
      *                                                                 06740000
             When other                                                 06750000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06760000
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06770000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06780000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06790000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)06800000
               Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID  To WD-Fin-Inst-ID              06810000
               Move  TFMC-Contr-No       To WD-Contr-No                 06820000
               String WD-Fin-Inst-ID           Delimited by size        06830000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        06840000
                      TFMC-Contr-Type          Delimited by space       06850000
                      WD-Contr-No              Delimited by space       06860000
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)06870000
               End-String                                               06880000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06890000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              06900000
                                         To    True                     06910000
      *                                                                 06920000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06930000
      *                                                                 06940000
           .                                                            06950000
      *################################################################.06960000
       F100-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       06970000
      *                                                                 06980000
      * We fill in the host variables for the SQL.                      06990000
      *                                                                 07000000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Main-Contract      07010000
      *                                                                 07020000
           Move  R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       07030000
           Move  R115IMC0-In-Contract-Type                              07040000
                                         To    TFMC-Contr-Type          07050000
           Move  R115IMC0-In-Contract-No To    TFMC-Contr-No            07060000
