           If  R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-No   Not = Space                    07080000
           and R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID   =     +0                       07090000
               Move  R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            07100000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            07110000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           07120000
