      *################################################################.07550000
       G100-Move-Input-To-DCL            Section.                       07560000
      *                                                                 07570000
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                07580000
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     07590000
      *    the same modifications in module F115AMC0 - E200-section.    07600000
      *                                                                 07610000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Main-Contract      07620000
      *                                                                 07630000
           Move R115IMC0-Fin-Inst-ID     To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       07640000
           If  R115IMC0-Fin-Inst-No      Not = Space                    07650000
