           End-If                                                       08050000
           Move  R7919100-Ut-Dato-DB2    To    TFMC-Register-Date       08060000
      *                                                                 08070000
           Move  R115IMC0-Upd-User-ID    To    TFMC-User-ID             08080000
      *                                                                 08090000
           If  R115IMC0-Upd-Timestamp    =     Space                    08100000
             Then                                                       08110000
